ulligan @futuristguy Hey Janet... I don't mind disagreeing with you but I don't want to misrepresent you. Which claim was untrue? That you hosted Wilson? Promote male headship? Dislike #MeToo ? Think PP was treated unfairly? See a mob mentality around the PP coverage? Happy to correct the record.","userId":576636693,"media":null,"username":"RLStollar","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":9,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":28,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1003649949941186560,"date":1528123769000,"rawContent":"Bill Clinton being a tool about #MeToo: \"The former president said he has not apologized privately to Lewinsky \u2013 nor spoken to her at all \u2013 and that he does not believe such an apology is necessary.\" https:\/\/t.co\/ZGQdOO4dNh","userId":576636693,"media":null,"username":"RLStollar","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":9,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":29,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":10.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1003819155240280064,"date":1528164111000,"rawContent":"Here's @World_mag's less-than-ideal take on #MeToo, which makes no mention of #ChurchToo and wastes time arguing that we should\u00a0\"understand Patterson\u2019s reluctance to advise divorce to an abused spouse.\" Come on, World. Do better. https:\/\/t.co\/HRbUpvibKv","userId":576636693,"media":null,"username":"RLStollar","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":9,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":30,"sumOfClimat